{"id":"bc-093","statement":"A mapped type `as` clause can rename keys or filter them by returning `never`.","truth":true,"explanation":"The `as` clause re-maps keys via template literals or conditional types. Filtering is done by returning `never`, which strips that key entirely from the resulting object type.","level":"senior","category":"typescript","subject":"generics","codeSnippet":"type Getters<T> = {\n  [K in keyof T as `get${Capitalize<string & K>}`]: () => T[K];\n};","codeLanguage":"typescript","codeHtml":"<span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">type</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> Getters</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2;font-style:italic\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\">T</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2;font-style:italic\">></span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> {</span><br><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\">K</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> in</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> keyof</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\"> as</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> `</span><span style=\"color:#F1FA8C\">get</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">${</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\">Capitalize</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2;font-style:italic\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\">string </span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6;font-style:italic\">&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> K</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2;font-style:italic\">></span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">]</span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">:</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#FF79C6\">=></span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\"> T</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">[</span><span style=\"color:#8BE9FD;font-style:italic\">K</span><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">];</span><br><span style=\"color:#F8F8F2\">};</span>"}